<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">chrysalis-glow</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Chrysalis Glow</ansi> spell coaxes dormant Chrysalis spores to luminesce,
suffusing the caster in a soft, otherworldly radiance. Beyond mere
illumination, the spell leaves the caster with a beneficial effect
that enhances their abilities for a time.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast chrysalis-glow</ansi>

