  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> N/A
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 35
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Applies a beneficial glow condition

